WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Review an underwriting result. Open a borrower in Origination. All records shown here are fictional.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Start with Overview. Review the risk package and the application context together.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Read the assessment. A recommendation supports your review. Your institution makes the lending decision.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Inspect API request. Check the submitted application facts and supporting references.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Compare API response. Review the returned resource, processing status and result references.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Review Documents. Find associated evidence. Open a file record to inspect its available details.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check Integrations. Compare connection status, data availability and source timestamps.

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Return to the list. Close the drawer to continue reviewing your records.
